cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the paper for the research methods and results, and the archived
  software release when using this code. Record the Git commit used in calculations.
type: software
title: "GHZPreserving.jl: GHZ-Preserving Circuit Optimization Library"
authors:
  - family-names: Wang
    given-names: Mingyuan
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mingyuan1231/GHZ_Preserving"
url: "https://github.com/Mingyuan1231/GHZ_Preserving"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.17470505"
abstract: >-
  Julia research software for simulating GHZ-preserving Clifford operations
  using binary GHZ-basis labels and cached permutations, with genetic
  circuit-search scripts for GHZ entanglement distillation.
keywords:
  - GHZ states
  - entanglement distillation
  - entanglement purification
  - Clifford gates
  - quantum networks
  - circuit optimization
  - Julia
preferred-citation:
